{"t":"MKC","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","employees":14100,"hq":"Hunt Valley, MD, United States","website":"https://www.mccormickcorporation.com","summary_en":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated manufactures, markets, and distributes herbs, spices, seasoning mixes, condiments, and other flavorful products to the food industry. It operates in two segments, Consumer and Flavor Solutions. The Consumer segment offers spices, herbs, and seasonings, as well as condiments, sauces, and desserts. This segment markets its products under the McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot, Lawry's, Cholula Hot Sauce, Club House, Gourmet Garden, and OLD BAY brands in the Americas; Ducros, Schwartz, Kamis, LA Drogheria, and Vahiné brands in Europe, the Middle East, and Africa; and McCormick and DaQiao brands in the Asia/Pacific (APAC), as well as desserts under the Aeroplane brand; and packaged chilled herbs under the Gourmet Garden brand. Its authentic regional brands include Zatarain's, Stubb's, Thai Kitchen, and Simply Asia. The company also supplies its products under private labels. This segment serves retailers, including grocery, mass merchandise, warehouse clubs, discount and drug stores, and e-commerce retailers directly and indirectly through distributors and wholesale foodservice suppliers. The Flavor Solutions segment offers seasoning blends, spices, herbs, condiments, coating systems, and compound flavors to multinational food manufacturers and foodservice customers. It serves foodservice customers directly and indirectly through distributors. The company was founded in 1889 and is headquartered in Hunt Valley, Maryland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated는 허브, 향신료, 조미료 혼합물, 조미료 및 기타 향미 제품을 제조, 판매 및 식품 산업에 유통합니다. 소비자 솔루션과 맛 솔루션이라는 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 소비자 부문에서는 향신료, 허브, 조미료는 물론 조미료, 소스, 디저트도 제공합니다. 이 부문은 미주 지역에서 McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot, Lawry's, Cholula Hot Sauce, Club House, Gourmet Garden 및 OLD BAY 브랜드로 제품을 판매합니다. 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카의 Ducros, Schwartz, Kamis, LA Drogheria 및 Vahiné 브랜드; 아시아/태평양(APAC)의 McCormick 및 DaQiao 브랜드와 비행기 브랜드의 디저트; Gourmet Garden 브랜드로 냉장 허브를 포장했습니다. 정통 지역 브랜드로는 Zatarain's, Stubb's, Thai Kitchen, Simply Asia가 있습니다. 이 회사는 또한 자사 브랜드로 제품을 공급합니다. 이 부문은 식료품점, 대량 상품, 창고 클럽, 할인 및 약국, 전자 상거래 소매업체를 포함한 소매업체에 유통업체 및 식품 서비스 도매 공급업체를 통해 직간접적으로 서비스를 제공합니다. 맛 솔루션 부문은 다국적 식품 제조업체 및 식품 서비스 고객에게 조미료 혼합, 향신료, 허브, 조미료, 코팅 시스템 및 복합 맛을 제공합니다. 유통업체를 통해 직간접적으로 식품 서비스 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1889년에 설립되었으며 메릴랜드 주 헌트 밸리에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":50.06,"mcap":13469368320.0,"pe":9.052442,"fpe":15.539876,"peg":3.1351,"ps":1.7525233,"pb":1.9233134,"ev_ebitda":12.459,"div":3.84,"beta":0.669,"hi52":72.41,"lo52":43.25},"fin":{"rev":7685700096.0,"rev_g":0.174,"eps_g":-0.571,"gross":0.38914,"op":0.1776,"net":0.19393,"roe":0.22623,"fcf":742000000.0,"cash":331100000.0,"debt":5018200064.0,"de":66.141,"eps":5.53,"feps":3.22139},"own":{"short":null,"inst":0.96830004,"insider":0.00013},"analyst":{"n":14,"mean":54.455,"median":55.0,"high":65.0,"low":47.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.26667,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-02","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":47.0,"priorPriceTarget":55.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":48.0,"priorPriceTarget":52.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-02","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":65.0,"priorPriceTarget":75.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10